{"id": "t095-057", "text": "Seo-yeon told me she and Lin broke up. Their anniversary dinner was meant to be next Friday. Call her this weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Seo-yeon", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "broke up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Friday"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Call her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t095-058", "text": "Jun's leaving for a new job in Tokyo early Feb. Big farewell dinner the week before, Yasmin organising. Remind me to RSVP and ask Jun what he wants as a leaving present, maybe a good travel bag.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jun", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job in Tokyo", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early Feb", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "farewell dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yasmin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "RSVP", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Jun what he wants as a leaving present", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jun", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "t095-059", "text": "Aleksander's firm's summer party is sometime in July, he's on the organising committee and it's eating his evenings.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aleksander", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "summer party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in July", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "on the organising committee", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t095-060", "text": "Yusuf asked me to be best man!!! Wedding is 18 Oct next year. Stag sometime in Sept. Must start a group chat with Tobi and Dong.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "18 Oct next year", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Stag", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in Sept", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "start a group chat with Tobi and Dong", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tobi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dong", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
